        return out("at that time, hew (10:1) — the second ascent's line (moses_ascended Exod 34:2) by kind: EXPANDED, the ark's clause added to God's word of 34:1 (six of eighteen shared; 24:12's 'come up to Me' with the vav here alone; 'an ark of wood' the one seat)", ['accepted'])
