        dat('the readback row 10:3 VARIANT — the tape\'s vessel_made \'ark\' (Exodus 37:1-9, subject the craftsmen) by kind and first verse; THE TAPE\'S ORDER IS THE RETELLING\'S: vessel_made \'ark\' sits at day 894460 by inheritance of the second ascent\'s marker (the erection\'s unmarked stretch) — BEFORE the tablets\' delivery at 894500: 10:3 the ark made before the ascent, 10:5 the tablets put in after the descent — where Exodus\'s page order (35-40 after 34) is not: a DATA row, no change (DB4 asserts the two days)')
